  "t": 67,
  "q": "The graph of y = f(x), shown below, has domain −4 ≤ x ≤ 4. It is made of 4 line segments whose endpoints are (−4,0), (−2,4), (0,0), (2,−2), and (4,2). How many values of x satisfy f(f(x)) = 0 ?",
